## Current System State

### Working end-to-end
- User registration/login (Breeze) — customers → home; admins → `/admin` (role-based)
- Product browse (home, filtered listing, detail)
- Add to cart → cart page → checkout → order + order items in DB
- Corporate inquiry form → `corporate_inquiries` table → admin list + status patch
- Newsletter subscribe
- Admin dashboard stats (basic)

### Working but limited
- **Cart drawer** — only for `@auth` users; dispatches `toggle-cart` event; fetches `GET /cart/summary`
- **Wishlist** — DB table + toggle; no "in wishlist" heart state on product card yet
- **Reviews** — schema + display on product page if `is_approved`; no public submit form
- **Variants / gallery** — DB tables exist; admin UI to manage them does not
- **Coupons** — table exists; not applied in `CheckoutController`
- **Admin CRUD** — products, categories, banners, testimonials, FAQs (create/edit/delete). Orders & inquiries list-only.
- **Admin** — product variants/gallery not yet in forms; image upload needs `php artisan storage:link`

### Auth-gated (unchanged from MVP)
Cart, checkout, wishlist, cart summary API require `auth` middleware. Guests see "Login to add" on products.

