## Known Issues / Gotcha

| Issue | Workaround |
|-------|------------|
| `php` / `npm` not on PATH (XAMPP) | Use `c:\xampp\php\php.exe artisan ...` |
| Product columns missing after migrate | Run fix migration `140900_*`; original add-columns migration ran empty |
| `db:seed` fails on `OrderSeeder` duplicate coupon `GLOW100` | Seed individually or fix OrderSeeder to `updateOrCreate` |
| Assets not styled | Run `npm run build` |
| `$navCategories` empty | Run `CategorySeeder`; `AppServiceProvider` checks `Schema::hasTable` |
| WhatsApp links | Placeholder `919000000000` — search views and replace |

