## Data Model Quick Reference

**`products.product_type`:** `personal` | `corporate` | `festival` | `combo`  
**`corporate_inquiries.status`:** `pending` | `in_progress` | `resolved` (admin patch)  
**Cart session:** `session('cart')[slug] => ['name','price','quantity','image'?]`

**Homepage product queries (HomePageService):**
- `newArrivals` — latest active
- `bestSellers` — `is_bestseller`
- `trending` — `is_trending`
- `corporateProducts`, `festivalProducts`, `comboProducts`, `personalProducts` — by `product_type`

